Package: bdex-framegen
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libvulkan1, python3
Recommends: python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Suggests: vulkan-tools
Description: frame generation and upscaling Vulkan layer for games
 Generates extra frames between a game's own (optical flow on the GPU, x2
 to x8 or adaptive, interpolation or extrapolation) and upscales, as an
 implicit Vulkan layer: native Vulkan games and Direct3D games under Proton
 (DXVK, VKD3D-Proton). Inert until turned on (control panel
 bdex-framegen-gui, or BDEX_FG=1); games protected by an anti-cheat are left
 alone. On amd64 the package also carries the 32-bit layer, for 32-bit games.
